\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 1ra\endash 11\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 vb Codex Justinianus cum glossa Accursii, C. 10.2 (1v\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  1r nicht bestimmt) C. 10.4 (2r\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  2v nicht bestimmt) C. \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 10.10.1 \endash  19.2\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  (Bl. 3, 4), C. \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 10.27 \endash  32.42 (Bl. 5, 6), C. 10.36 \endash  46.1 (Bl. 7, 8), C. 10.71.4 (?) \endash  73.1 (Bl. 9), C.\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 11.62 \endash  66 (Bl. 10), C. 11.73 \endash  12.5 (Bl. 11).\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 12ra\endash 15\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 va Liber feudorum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 cum glossa, cap. 3 \endash  8 (Bl. 12), cap. 44 \endash  53 (Bl. 13,\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  14), cap. 61 (Bl. 15). \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \endash \plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  Ed. Karl Lehmann, Das Langobardische Lehnrecht (Handschriften, Textentwicklung, \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u228 \'e4ltester\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  Text und Vulgattext nebst den capitula extraordinaria). \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 Goettingen 1896, S. 81 \endash  206. 15va\endash 16\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 vb Friedrich II., \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 r\u246 \'f6m.\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  Kaiser: De statutis et consuetudinibus contra libertatem ecclesiae\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  Fredericus dei gracia Romanorum imperator \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ... \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22 De statutis et consuetudinibus circa \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (dar\u252 \'fcber\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  in feiner Schrift: contra) libertates ecclesie editis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 .\u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  Svnt hec leges ad decus et honorem \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  ...\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  nichilominus puniendus. Nos uero Honorius episcopus seruus seruorum \plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 ...\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  pro utilitate omnium christianorum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Ed. Ludwig Weiland, Constitutiones et acta\plain \f1\lang1041\fs22  publica imperatorum et regum. Bd. 2. Hannover 1896 (Monumenta Germaniae \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 Historica, Leges 4, 2), S. 107 \endash  109\plain \f3\lang1033\fs22 .}

