\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f3\scaps\lang1041\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}\plain \f0\fs22 . (1r )... \plain \f3\i\lang1041\fs22 quia dei filius pro salute nostra in mundum venit. Ideo ewangelium subditur Cum appropinquasset Ihesus etc. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f3\i\lang1041\fs22 Sermo in parasceue secundum\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [Mattheum].\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f3\i\lang1041\fs22  Iesus autem voce magna . . .\plain \f0\fs22  (Mt 27,50). \plain \f3\i\lang1041\fs22 Circa diem hodiernum quattuor nobis sunt consideranda. Primo cur in lingno et non per aliam mortem Christus mori voluit\plain \f0\fs22  ... (2r ) ... \plain \f3\i\lang1041\fs22 cuius oracio celum clausit, talis Iosue qui solem stare fecit. Valet ergo oracio in celo, in terra, in aere, in mare \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 .\u8250 \'9bI\plain \f3\i\lang1041\fs22 n assumpcione domini secundum Marcum\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 .\u8249 \'8b\plain \f3\i\lang1041\fs22  Et dominus Iesus postquam locutus est . . .\plain \f0\fs22  (Mc 16,19).\plain \f3\i\lang1041\fs22  In auctoritate ista tria nobis sunt consideranda. Primo quod dominus discipulis locutus fuit \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 . . . \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \endash  Dieselben Sermones\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 auch in Freiburg, Universit\u228 \'e4tsbibliothek, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hs. 138}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , 33\plain \f0\fs22 ra und 49ra , siehe Winfried Hagenmaier, Die lateini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 schen mittelalterlichen Handschriften der Universit\u228 \'e4ts-\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 bibliothek Freiburg im Breisgau. Wiesbaden 1974 (Kataloge der Universit\u228 \'e4tsbibliothek Freiburg im Breisgau 1,1), S. 106 \endash  108.}

